{"id":"o-mcleanmill-ca","claimKey":"771db8a08f531f0df19b6efb6ea1564b15e9542a4241b7ced2487413cebddb06","title":"McLean Mill National Historic Site","cat":"play","art":"museum","area":"Vancouver, BC","metroId":"vancouver","src":"mcleanmill.ca","specs":[],"options":[{"name":"Private and Corporate Events","detail":"","price":null},{"name":"The Bunkhouse","detail":"","price":null}],"services":[{"name":"Private and Corporate Events","desc":null,"photo":"https://content.app-sources.com/s/87071276021672491/thumbnails/640x480/WeddingEvents/49210652_10155788874796319_2672456435438190592_n-5393350.jpg?format=webp","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":0}]},{"name":"The Bunkhouse","desc":"This historic building that stands here is the last bunkhouse standing on the site. Throughout the years there were several bunkhouses, each home to 4-6 single men. This historic building that stands here is the last bunkhouse standing on the site. Throughout the years there were several bunkhouses, each home to 4-6 single men. At its most populated, 11 men lived in a bunkhouse. In this bunkhouse, the central living space is separated from the bedroom by short walls. The height of the walls allowed heat from the stove to radiate through the building. The only plumbing was a sink in the central room. Coldwater was piped in from the main mill pipeline and an outhouse stood outback. The","photo":"https://content.app-sources.com/s/87071276021672491/uploads/Images/The_Bunkhouse3125-4338597.jpg?format=webp","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":1}]}],"includes":[],"addons":[],"gap":"Prices, hours and eligibility are not copied here yet. We will ask when you request.","blurb":"The site is open from dawn to dusk, 365 days a year for you to explore at your own risk.","cover":"https://content.app-sources.com/s/87071276021672491/thumbnails/640x480/Images/Mill_view_July_2021-8052441.jpg?format=webp","photos":["https://content.app-sources.com/s/87071276021672491/thumbn